                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.51/4167: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Haiti</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Sparks</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port-au-Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-02-15T11:00:00-05:00">February 15, 1941—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 12:33 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>28. Legation’s telegram No. 26, February 13, 5 p.m. Enabling legislation to put
                    into effect the supplementary executive agreement was enacted and promulgated
                    yesterday.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sparks</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
